  "experiment": "J0_judge_version_bridge",
  "purpose": "Measure the per-dimension satisfied-rate offset between the deprecated banked Claude judges (Opus 4.1 = 'claude_opus', Sonnet 4.5 = 'claude_sonnet') and the current accessible Claude judges (Opus 4.8, Sonnet 5), by re-judging a stratified sample of the ORIGINAL headline reports BLIND on the SAME banked criteria and comparing to the banked verdicts on identical (pattern, query_id, criterion_id).",
